 | 11.46; 3513 | 12.22; 3372 | 0.12; 68 |\n| `vector-growth` | 0.52; 32 | 0.05; 16 | 0.26; 16 | 0.19; 4432 | 0.08; 4432 | 11.24; 3515 | 12.22; 3376 | 0.10; 68 |\n| `string-building` | 0.54; 32 | 0.06; 16 | 0.35; 16 | 0.09; 4432 | 0.09; 4433 | 11.12; 3518 | 12.05; 3380 | 0.11; 68 |\n| `recursion` | 0.49; 32 | 0.05; 16 | 0.07; 16 | 0.12; 4431 | 0.07; 4431 | 0.14; 131 | 12.36; 3366 | 0.10; 68 |\n| `linked-list` | 0.60; 32 | 0.05; 16 | 0.54; 16 | 0.08; 4432 | 0.08; 4432 | 11.14; 3520 | 12.04; 3371 | 0.09; 68 |\n| `binary-trees` | 0.55; 32 | 0.05; 16 | 0.52; 16 | 0.08; 4433 | 0.09; 4433 | 10.91; 3515 | 12.31; 3375 | 0.11; 72 |\n| `hash-map` | 0.60; 32 | 0.05; 16 | 0.26; 16 | 0.09; 4431 | 0.09; 4432 | 11.33; 3513 | 12.09; 3373 | 0.11; 68 |\n| `parsing` | 0.54; 32 | 0.06; 16 | 0.25; 16 | 0.09; 4432 | 0.11; 4433 | 11.44; 3526 | 12.38; 3384 | 0.12; 68 |\n| `memory-copy` | 0.58; 32 | 0.06; 16 | 0.37; 16 | 0.10; 4432 | 0.09; 4433 | 11.37; 3511 | 12.19; 3371 | 0.13; 72 |\n| `numeric` | 0.56; 32 | 0.06; 16 | 0.23; 16 | 0.13; 4432 | 0.11; 4433 | 10.98; 3514 | 12.17; 3374 | 0.11; 68 |\n| `data-oriented` | 0.58; 32 | 0.06; 16 | 0.22; 16 | 0.10; 4432 | 0.09; 4433 | 11.19; 3514 | 12.21; 3374 | 0.12; 68 |\n\n**Wall time, ms, and relative to C (x86_64 Linux, gcc (Debian 12.2.0-14+deb12u1) 12.2.0, median of 5 runs)**\n\n| Workload | nova | c | cpp | rust | rust-checked | zig | zig-safe | goose |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| `small-objects` | 371 (1.24) | 299 (1.00) | 378 (1.26) | 367 (1.23) | 371 (1.24) | 291 (0.98) | 297 (0.99) | — |\n| `large-objects` | 931 (3.02) | 309 (1.00) | 276 (0.89) | 283 (0.92) | 288 (0.93) | 305 (0.99) | 275 (0.89) | — |\n| `stack-alloc` | 1134 (1.60) | 710 (1.00) | 723 (1.02) | 514 (0.72) | 625 (0.88) | 418 (0.59) | 552 (0.78) | 1241 (1.75) |\n| `heap-alloc` | 799 (1.82) | 440 (1.00) | 580 (1.32) | 550 (1.25) | 591 (1.34) | 192 (0.44) | 568 (1.29) | — |\n| `arena` | 1794 (2.27) | 791 (1.00) | 786 (0.99) | 547 (0.69) | 589 (0.75) | 815 (1